.TH FATHOM_ATTRIBUTION_LIST 1  "fathom 0.1.0-alpha.1" 
.SH NAME
fathom\-attribution\-list \- List the stored corrections, which are the keys the classifier honours
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfathom attribution list\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List the stored corrections, which are the keys the classifier honours
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
The repository to read
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the corrections as JSON on stdout, and nothing else there
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
